# Personal preferences — copy this file to AGENTS.local.md
#
#   cp AGENTS.local.md.example AGENTS.local.md
#
# AGENTS.local.md is gitignored, so what you write here stays on your machine.
# AGENTS.md references it with `@AGENTS.local.md`, which is what makes an agent read it.
# If you never create the file, nothing happens — a missing reference is skipped silently.
#
# Keep this to preferences that are yours rather than the project's. Project rules
# belong in AGENTS.md where the whole team gets them.

## Example: how I want to be talked to

Lead with the answer, then the evidence. Skip the preamble.

## Example: my local setup

I run the demo flavor by default. Assume `./gradlew assembleDemoDebug` unless I say otherwise.

## Example: a habit I want reinforced

When you open a pull request, remind me to brush my teeth — and to floss too.
